---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<PageLayout meta={{ title: "Work Together — Kiran S Baliga" }}>
	<div class="pt-6 pb-16 sm:pt-8 sm:pb-20">
		{/* Intro */}
		<header class="mb-14">
			<h1 class="font-sans text-[34px] leading-[1.3] font-normal text-[#262625] dark:text-[#f5f4f1] mb-6">
				Good work starts with a conversation.
			</h1>

			<div class="space-y-4 font-sans text-[17px] leading-[1.65] text-[#444441] dark:text-neutral-300 max-w-2xl mb-8">
				<p>
					I’m Kiran, a backend &amp; AI engineer in Kerala, India. I build the systems behind products &mdash; and the tools that help other people build on them.
				</p>
				<p>
					I’m open to my next full-time role, as well as carefully scoped consulting and freelance work. Two different ways to work together; the same care for the details.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6">
				<div class="relative inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 select-none">
					<span class="font-sans text-base text-[#262625] dark:text-[#f5f4f1] relative z-10">
						Available immediately
					</span>
					<svg
						class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-x-2 -inset-y-1.5 w-[calc(100%+16px)] h-[calc(100%+12px)] overflow-visible"
						viewBox="0 0 209 48"
						fill="none"
						preserveAspectRatio="none"
						xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
						aria-hidden="true"
					>
						<path
							d="M162.029 2.92454C84.1186 -3.19881 1.99694 4.14921 0.944102 26.1933C-3.26726 49.462 138.866 53.1361 205.195 37.2153C220.988 16.3959 171.504 -3.19881 103.07 2.92454"
							stroke-width="1.7"
							stroke="#EE2796"
						/>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<span class="font-sans text-sm text-[#797974] dark:text-neutral-400">
					Remote &middot; Open to relocation
				</span>
			</div>
		</header>

		{/* Full-time Hiring */}
		<section class="border-t border-[#deded8] pt-10 pb-14 dark:border-neutral-800">
			<h2 class="font-sans text-[23px] font-normal text-[#262625] dark:text-[#f5f4f1] mb-4">
				Hire me, full-time
			</h2>

			<p class="font-sans text-[17px] leading-[1.65] text-[#444441] dark:text-neutral-300 max-w-2xl mb-8">
				I’m looking for backend and AI engineering roles where I can contribute to distributed systems, agent infrastructure and developer tooling. My experience spans production backends, LLM orchestration, multi-tenant platforms and SDKs.
			</p>

			<div class="relative flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 mb-12">
				<a
					class="font-sans text-[17px] text-[#262625] hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200 dark:text-[#f5f4f1]"
					href="/resume.pdf"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
				>
					Download my r&eacute;sum&eacute; &nearr;
				</a>
				<a
					class="font-sans text-[17px] text-[#262625] hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200 dark:text-[#f5f4f1]"
					href="mailto:kiransbaliga@gmail.com?subject=Full-time%20Engineering%20Role"
				>
					Email about a role &rarr;
				</a>
				<span class="font-handwriting text-2xl text-[#797974] dark:text-neutral-400 rotate-[-3deg] select-none">
					a good place to start
				</span>
			</div>

			{/* Technical Capabilities */}
			<div class="space-y-6 pt-2">
				<div>
					<h3 class="font-sans text-[17px] font-medium text-[#262625] dark:text-[#f5f4f1] mb-1">
						Distributed backends
					</h3>
					<p class="font-sans text-[17px] leading-[1.65] text-[#444441] dark:text-neutral-300">
						Node.js / TypeScript, Python / FastAPI, Rails, PostgreSQL and event queues. AWS and Docker for the systems around them.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="font-sans text-[17px] font-medium text-[#262625] dark:text-[#f5f4f1] mb-1">
						AI &amp; agent infrastructure
					</h3>
					<p class="font-sans text-[17px] leading-[1.65] text-[#444441] dark:text-neutral-300">
						MCP servers, OpenAI / Anthropic orchestration, LangChain and CrewAI integrations, schema extraction and evaluation.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="font-sans text-[17px] font-medium text-[#262625] dark:text-[#f5f4f1] mb-1">
						Developer tooling &amp; product engineering
					</h3>
					<p class="font-sans text-[17px] leading-[1.65] text-[#444441] dark:text-neutral-300">
						TypeScript and Python SDKs, REST / GraphQL APIs and tenant schemas. React for the web; Flutter and offline-first patterns for mobile.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		{/* Experience and Education */}
		<section class="border-t border-[#deded8] pt-10 pb-14 dark:border-neutral-800">
			<h2 class="font-sans text-[23px] font-normal text-[#262625] dark:text-[#f5f4f1] mb-8">
				The path so far
			</h2>

			<div class="space-y-8">
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[130px_1fr] gap-2 sm:gap-6">
					<span class="font-sans text-[13px] text-[#797974] dark:text-neutral-400 tabular-nums pt-1">
						Mar&ndash;Jun 2026
					</span>
					<div class="space-y-1">
						<h3 class="font-sans text-base font-medium text-[#262625] dark:text-[#f5f4f1]">
							Backend Engineer &middot; Ultrahuman
						</h3>
						<p class="font-sans text-sm leading-[1.6] text-[#444441] dark:text-neutral-300">
							Remote. Clinical reporting across 10+ lab stations, CJK localization and a behavioral Powerplug upsell pipeline that drove 8,000+ subscription conversions in 60 days. Ruby / Rails, PostgreSQL, KMP and AWS.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[130px_1fr] gap-2 sm:gap-6">
					<span class="font-sans text-[13px] text-[#797974] dark:text-neutral-400 tabular-nums pt-1">
						Sep 2023&ndash;Feb 2026
					</span>
					<div class="space-y-1">
						<h3 class="font-sans text-base font-medium text-[#262625] dark:text-[#f5f4f1]">
							Associate Software Engineer &middot; KeyValue Software Systems
						</h3>
						<p class="font-sans text-sm leading-[1.6] text-[#444441] dark:text-neutral-300">
							Client engagements with Pencil and Siren. Built a custom ORM with automatic tenant scoping and a headless Puppeteer export pipeline for Pencil; led developer tooling and MCP servers for Siren. Node.js, Python, PostgreSQL, Docker, MCP.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[130px_1fr] gap-2 sm:gap-6">
					<span class="font-sans text-[13px] text-[#797974] dark:text-neutral-400 tabular-nums pt-1">
						Jul 2022&ndash;Jun 2023
					</span>
					<div class="space-y-1">
						<h3 class="font-sans text-base font-medium text-[#262625] dark:text-[#f5f4f1]">
							Full Stack Developer &middot; TGH Tech
						</h3>
						<p class="font-sans text-sm leading-[1.6] text-[#444441] dark:text-neutral-300">
							Built the backend services for a mental-health platform with live booking, therapist matching and encrypted session records. Node.js, Express, MongoDB, AWS.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[130px_1fr] gap-2 sm:gap-6">
					<span class="font-sans text-[13px] text-[#797974] dark:text-neutral-400 tabular-nums pt-1">
						Jan 2022&ndash;Jun 2022
					</span>
					<div class="space-y-1">
						<h3 class="font-sans text-base font-medium text-[#262625] dark:text-[#f5f4f1]">
							Mobile Developer &middot; airPMO
						</h3>
						<p class="font-sans text-sm leading-[1.6] text-[#444441] dark:text-neutral-300">
							Flutter application for construction project management, offline-first sync with SQLite and background sync queues.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		{/* Contact */}
		<section class="border-t border-[#deded8] pt-10 dark:border-neutral-800">
			<h2 class="font-sans text-[23px] font-normal text-[#262625] dark:text-[#f5f4f1] mb-6">
				Get in touch
			</h2>

			<div class="space-y-3 font-sans text-[17px]">
				<div>
					<a
						class="text-[#262625] hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200 dark:text-[#f5f4f1]"
						href="mailto:kiransbaliga@gmail.com"
					>
						kiransbaliga@gmail.com &nearr;
					</a>
				</div>
				<div>
					<a
						class="text-[#262625] hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200 dark:text-[#f5f4f1]"
						href="https://twitter.com/kiransbaliga"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
					>
						Twitter / X &nearr;
					</a>
				</div>
				<div>
					<a
						class="text-[#262625] hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200 dark:text-[#f5f4f1]"
						href="https://linkedin.com/in/kiransbaliga"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
					>
						LinkedIn &nearr;
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
